# Reviewed TruffleHog path exclusions (robotsix-standards
# docs/secret-files-are-never-tracked.md). One RE2/Go regex per line, matched
# against repo-relative paths and consumed by the python-security job in
# .github/workflows/ci.yml via `--exclude-paths=.secrets-patterns-excluded`.
# Adding a pattern is a deliberate, reviewed decision — keep the list minimal.

# Generated OpenAPI snapshot and drift baseline: schema examples only, never
# real credentials (regenerated by _gen_openapi.py).
^docs/lifecycle/openapi\.json$
^docs/lifecycle/openapi\.json\.baseline$

# Shared pytest fixtures: build synthetic API keys, tokens and Fernet keys for
# the test suite.
^tests/(.*/)?conftest\.py$
